<title>BELGIUM: SGB stake in Tractebel to fall to 50.27%.</title>
<headline>SGB stake in Tractebel to fall to 50.27%.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stake Belgian holding company Societe Generale de Belgique SA holds in its utility unit Tractebel will fall to 50.27 percent from 64.22 percent after the merger of Tractebel with its unit Powerfin, Tractebel said in its 1966 annual report.</p>
<p>The merger between Tractebel and Powerfin, the unit handling Tractebel's foreign activities, is to be completed later this month.</p>
<p>SGB had boosted its Tractebel stake in September 1996 when it bought the shares owned by Belgian holding company GBL in Tractebel.</p>
